  (= (cost) 0)
  (= (x farm0) 600)
  (= (x farm1) 1)
  (adj farm0 farm1)
  (adj farm1 farm0)
Goal:
  (and (>= (+ (* 1 (x farm0)) (+ (* 1.7 (x farm1)) 0)) 840) (>= (x farm0) 1) (>= (x farm1) 1))
Metric:
Pred prop:
  (= object object): in_pre in_pre_neg
